{"page":84,"verses":[{"verse_key":"4:34","surah":4,"ayah":34,"ar_uthmani":"ٱلرِّجَالُ قَوَّٰمُونَ عَلَى ٱلنِّسَآءِ بِمَا فَضَّلَ ٱللَّهُ بَعْضَهُمْ عَلَىٰ بَعْضٍ وَبِمَآ أَنفَقُوا۟ مِنْ أَمْوَٰلِهِمْ ۚ فَٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتُ قَـٰنِتَـٰتٌ حَـٰفِظَـٰتٌ لِّلْغَيْبِ بِمَا حَفِظَ ٱللَّهُ ۚ وَٱلَّـٰتِى تَخَافُونَ نُشُوزَهُنَّ فَعِظُوهُنَّ وَٱهْجُرُوهُنَّ فِى ٱلْمَضَاجِعِ وَٱضْرِبُوهُنَّ ۖ فَإِنْ أَطَعْنَكُمْ فَلَا تَبْغُوا۟ عَلَيْهِنَّ سَبِيلًا ۗ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ كَانَ عَلِيًّا كَبِيرًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Husbands should take good care of their wives, with [the bounties] God has given to some more than others and with what they spend out of their own money. Righteous wives are devout and guard what God would have them guard in their husbands’ absence. If you fear high-handedness from your wives, remind them [of the teachings of God], then ignore them when you go to bed, then hit them.If they obey you, you have no right to act against them: God is most high and great.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ٱلرِّجَالُ","en_gloss":"[The] men","transliteration":"al-rijālu","verse_key":"4:34"},{"pos":2,"ar":"قَوَّٰمُونَ","en_gloss":"(are) protectors","transliteration":"qawwāmūna","verse_key":"4:34"},{"pos":3,"ar":"عَلَى","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"4:34"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلنِّسَآءِ","en_gloss":"the women","transliteration":"l-nisāi","verse_key":"4:34"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بِمَا","en_gloss":"because","transliteration":"bimā","verse_key":"4:34"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فَضَّلَ","en_gloss":"(has) bestowed","transliteration":"faḍḍala","verse_key":"4:34"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"4:34"},{"pos":8,"ar":"بَعْضَهُمْ","en_gloss":"some of them","transliteration":"baʿḍahum","verse_key":"4:34"},{"pos":9,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"over","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"4:34"},{"pos":10,"ar":"بَعْضٍۢ","en_gloss":"others","transliteration":"baʿḍin","verse_key":"4:34"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَبِمَآ","en_gloss":"and because","transliteration":"wabimā","verse_key":"4:34"},{"pos":12,"ar":"أَنفَقُوا۟","en_gloss":"they spend","transliteration":"anfaqū","verse_key":"4:34"},{"pos":13,"ar":"مِنْ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"4:34"},{"pos":14,"ar":"أَمْوَٰلِهِمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"their wealth","transliteration":"amwālihim","verse_key":"4:34"},{"pos":15,"ar":"فَٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتُ","en_gloss":"So the righteous women","transliteration":"fal-ṣāliḥātu","verse_key":"4:34"},{"pos":16,"ar":"قَـٰنِتَـٰتٌ","en_gloss":"(are) obedient","transliteration":"qānitātun","verse_key":"4:34"},{"pos":17,"ar":"حَـٰفِظَـٰتٌۭ","en_gloss":"guarding","transliteration":"ḥāfiẓātun","verse_key":"4:34"},{"pos":18,"ar":"لِّلْغَيْبِ","en_gloss":"in the unseen","transliteration":"lil'ghaybi","verse_key":"4:34"},{"pos":19,"ar":"بِمَا","en_gloss":"that which","transliteration":"bimā","verse_key":"4:34"},{"pos":20,"ar":"حَفِظَ","en_gloss":"(orders) them to guard","transliteration":"ḥafiẓa","verse_key":"4:34"},{"pos":21,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ ۚ","en_gloss":"(by) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"4:34"},{"pos":22,"ar":"وَٱلَّـٰتِى","en_gloss":"And those (from) whom","transliteration":"wa-allātī","verse_key":"4:34"},{"pos":23,"ar":"تَخَافُونَ","en_gloss":"you fear","transliteration":"takhāfūna","verse_key":"4:34"},{"pos":24,"ar":"نُشُوزَهُنَّ","en_gloss":"their ill-conduct","transliteration":"nushūzahunna","verse_key":"4:34"},{"pos":25,"ar":"فَعِظُوهُنَّ","en_gloss":"then advise them","transliteration":"faʿiẓūhunna","verse_key":"4:34"},{"pos":26,"ar":"وَٱهْجُرُوهُنَّ","en_gloss":"and forsake them","transliteration":"wa-uh'jurūhunna","verse_key":"4:34"},{"pos":27,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"4:34"},{"pos":28,"ar":"ٱلْمَضَاجِعِ","en_gloss":"the bed","transliteration":"l-maḍājiʿi","verse_key":"4:34"},{"pos":29,"ar":"وَٱضْرِبُوهُنَّ ۖ","en_gloss":"and [finally] strike them","transliteration":"wa-iḍ'ribūhunna","verse_key":"4:34"},{"pos":30,"ar":"فَإِنْ","en_gloss":"Then if","transliteration