 other people to be the same, hiding the bounty God has given them. We have prepared a humiliating torment for such ungrateful people.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"Those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"4:37"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَبْخَلُونَ","en_gloss":"are stingy","transliteration":"yabkhalūna","verse_key":"4:37"},{"pos":3,"ar":"وَيَأْمُرُونَ","en_gloss":"and order","transliteration":"wayamurūna","verse_key":"4:37"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلنَّاسَ","en_gloss":"the people","transliteration":"l-nāsa","verse_key":"4:37"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بِٱلْبُخْلِ","en_gloss":"[of] stinginess","transliteration":"bil-bukh'li","verse_key":"4:37"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَيَكْتُمُونَ","en_gloss":"and hide","transliteration":"wayaktumūna","verse_key":"4:37"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مَآ","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"4:37"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ءَاتَىٰهُمُ","en_gloss":"(has) given them","transliteration":"ātāhumu","verse_key":"4:37"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"4:37"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"4:37"},{"pos":11,"ar":"فَضْلِهِۦ ۗ","en_gloss":"His Bounty ","transliteration":"faḍlihi","verse_key":"4:37"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَأَعْتَدْنَا","en_gloss":"and We (have) prepared","transliteration":"wa-aʿtadnā","verse_key":"4:37"},{"pos":13,"ar":"لِلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","en_gloss":"for the disbelievers","transliteration":"lil'kāfirīna","verse_key":"4:37"},{"pos":14,"ar":"عَذَابًۭا","en_gloss":"a punishment","transliteration":"ʿadhāban","verse_key":"4:37"},{"pos":15,"ar":"مُّهِينًۭا","en_gloss":"humiliating","transliteration":"muhīnan","verse_key":"4:37"},{"pos":16,"ar":"٣٧","en_gloss":"(37)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"4:37"}]}]}